WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:02.940
Hey YouTubers, it's Charlie!

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:05.700
So I was totally working on another video

00:00:05.780 --> 00:00:07.940
