00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.820
that I just need to make a separate announcements video.

00:00:10.956 --> 00:00:13.896
So I hallucinated that it would be a good idea to do something called 

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:15.760
The Emergencey Awesome Face Palm

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:18.369
and it'll be like a new weekly video series

00:00:18.369 --> 00:00:19.729
where I make announcements,

00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:22.340
