00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:24.060
or if I like derp on some giant video

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:26.720
or there's some big error that I didn't see wherever I posted something

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:29.000
So just in general these videos will be a little more informal,

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:30.720
like, a little more vloggy.

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:32.660
I know a lot of you have asked me to start doing vlogs

00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:34.060
and podcasty stuff

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:36.500
I'm not planning on doing a podcast any time soon

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:39.360
but I did need a video where I could just explain stuff

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:41.160
that didn't necessarily fit into

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:43.500
a Game of Thrones or a Star Wars video.

00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:45.680
I'm hoping this is going to make it easier for me to do

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:47.300
episodes videos and movie videos

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:50.100
without having to cram a bunch of announcements into each of those.

00:00:50.260 --> 00:00:52.480
Once I find a thumb nail design that I settle on

00:00:52.580 --> 00:00:54.200
I'll make all the thumb nails the same

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:55.940
so it'll be really easy to find.

00:00:55.940 --> 00:00:58.735
If you want to know what videos I'm going to be posting each week

00:00:58.735 --> 00:01:01.560
or what I did last week it'll be really easy to find that.

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:03.666
I'll even put a playlist on the home page here

00:01:03.666 --> 00:01:05.318
just so it's really easy for you guys to find

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:07.620
This is gonna be Face Palm #1

00:01:07.620 --> 00:01:09.880
so next week I'll post Face Palm #2

00:01:09.880 --> 00:01:12.980
So what I'm planning is on keeping these Emergency Awesome Face Palm videos

00:01:12.980 --> 00:01:14.760
 to 5 minutes in length

00:01:14.760 --> 00:01:16.280
If I feel like it needs to be longer or something

00:01:16.280 --> 00:01:17.960
I'll just do a live Twitch Q&amp;A

00:01:17.960 --> 00:01:19.835
or a stream or something like that.

00:01:19.835 --> 00:01:21.634
I am planning on doing more streaming

00:01:21.634 --> 00:01:24.260
if there is something that I'm planning ahead of time

00:01:24.260 --> 00:01:26.050
I will mention it in one of these videos

00:01:26.050 --> 00:01:27.270
So with that in mind,

00:01:27.270 --> 00:01:29.460
here are the videos that I'm working on this week

00:01:29.620 --> 00:01:31.140
So there is... 

00:01:31.140 --> 00:01:32.560
- let me look at my list here...

00:01:32.560 --> 00:01:34.320
 The Flash Episode #10, that's tonight.

00:01:34.460 --> 00:01:36.140
The Last Air Bender Episode #3

00:01:36.140 --> 00:01:37.060
That was gonna be -

00:01:37.060 --> 00:01:38.880
- that was the other video I was working on

00:01:38.880 --> 00:01:40.166
