00:01:40.260 --> 00:01:41.500
That'll be tomorrow morning.

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:42.920
Then Arrow Episode #10

00:01:42.920 --> 00:01:45.680
Then a Q&amp;A for Flash/Arrow/DC stuff!

00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:48.400
