00:02:03.420 --> 00:02:05.100
My biggest priorities this year are

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:06.801
#1 Keeping to my schedule!

00:02:06.801 --> 00:02:09.881
So if I say I'm going to post Game of Thrones and Walking Dead on Sunday

00:02:09.881 --> 00:02:12.047
I actually post those videos on Sunday.

00:02:12.047 --> 00:02:14.400
What I'm working on is my video schedule follows the 

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:16.780
TV schedule. So if something airs on a certain night

00:02:16.815 --> 00:02:19.775
you can look for that video later that night!

00:02:19.775 --> 00:02:22.035
The exception being, like, Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D for example.

00:02:22.035 --> 00:02:22.998
There are a couple of nights a week

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:24.500
