00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:02.209
I partnered with Youtube to test out their

00:03:02.209 --> 00:03:03.480
new Fansubs feature too

00:03:03.480 --> 00:03:06.600
So now you can actually submit your own subtitles

00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:08.140
