00:03:36.314 --> 00:03:37.634
So it's my hope that better subtitles

00:03:37.634 --> 00:03:40.174
will make it easier for you to participate.

00:03:40.180 --> 00:03:41.940
So that's really the important stuff:

00:03:41.940 --> 00:03:44.515
You know, Better Subtitles. Sticking to the Schedule.

00:03:44.515 --> 00:03:45.819
I know it sounds really simple.

00:03:45.819 --> 00:03:48.074
I always find that it's less stressful

00:03:48.074 --> 00:03:49.697
